6. Concurrent development script for both backend and frontend

The application meets all the goals specified in the task description:
- Provides a simple message board where users can post text messages
- Ensures all connected clients receive updates instantly when new messages are posted
- Stores data persistently on the local disk using PGLite
- Keeps the frontend incredibly simple and lightweight

Users can now:
1. Run `npm install` to install all dependencies
2. Run `npm run dev` to start both the backend and frontend
3. Visit the frontend in their browser (usually at http://localhost:5173)
4. Post messages and see them appear instantly in all connected clients
5. See the message history when they first load the page

The implementation follows all the decisions made in the task description:
